#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ការ​ពិពណ៌នា"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&ark; is a program for managing various archive formats within the &kde; "
"environment. Archives can be viewed, extracted, created and modified from "
"within &ark;. The program can handle various formats such as <command>tar</"
"command>, <command>gzip</command>, <command>bzip2</command>, <command>zip</"
"command>, <command>rar</command> and <command>lha</command> (if appropriate "
"command-line programs are installed)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &ark;"
msgstr "ដោយ​ប្រើ Ark"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening Archives"
msgstr "បើក​បណ្ណសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open an archive in &ark;, choose <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem> from "
"the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu. You can also open archive files by "
"dragging and dropping from &konqueror; or &dolphin;. Archive files should be "
"associated with &ark;, so you can also <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> "
"click a file in &konqueror; or &dolphin; and select <guimenuitem>Open with "
"&ark;</guimenuitem> to open it or select an extract action for this file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working with Files"
msgstr "ធ្វើការ​ជាមួយ​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Once an archive has been opened, you can perform various operations on "
#| "the files inside the archive. By <mousebutton>right</mousebutton> "
#| "clicking on a file within the archive, or selecting a file and using the "
#| "<guimenu>Action</guimenu> menu, you can choose what you want to do:"
msgid ""
"Once an archive has been opened, you can perform various operations on the "
"files inside the archive. By selecting a file and using the <guimenu>Action</"
"guimenu> menu, you can choose what you want to do:"
msgstr ""
"ពេល​បណ្ណសារ​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក អ្នក​អាច​ដំណើរ​ការ​ប្រតិបត្តិការ​ផ្សេង​ៗ​លើ​ឯកសារ​ខាងក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ ។ ដោយ​ចុច​ប៊ូតុង "
"<mousebutton>ស្ដាំ</mousebutton> លើ​ឯកសារ​ខាង​ក្នុង​បណ្ណសារ ឬ​ជ្រើស​ឯកសារ និង​ប្រើ​"
"ម៉ឺនុយ<guimenu>សកម្មភាព</guimenu> អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​អ្វី​ដែល​អ្នក​ចង់​ធ្វើ ៖"

